    "description": {
      "value": "<h2><em>Rank 1 Melee Technique</em></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>  6 Ki</li>\n<li><strong>Casting Time:</strong>  1 Bonus Action</li>\n<li><strong>Range:</strong>          Melee</li>\n<li><strong>Chargeable?:</strong>          No</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong>          Instantaneous</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Roll a <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>, dealing your <em>Unarmed Strike Damage Die</em> + 2d6 <em>Bludgeoning Damage</em>. On a successful hit the target must make a <em>Strength Saving Throw</em> or be knocked <em>Prone</em>.</p>\n<p>If you use this <strong>Technique</strong> after you cast a <strong>Melee Technique</strong>, you gain Advantage on the* <em>Combo Attack Roll</em>.</p>\n",
